Nami.

221
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,440
Nojiko, what is that?

222
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:43,200
Oh, you mean this?

223
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:44,740
It's nothing.

224
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:45,880
Just a tattoo.

225
00:12:47,300 --> 00:12:49,440
Now I look just like you.

226
